        formulaLatex: String.raw`w_E = \frac{\varepsilon\varepsilon_0 E^2}{2} = w_B = \frac{B^2}{2\mu_0}, \qquad S = \frac{EB}{\mu_0} = c\cdot w_{\text{повн}}`,
