        formulaLatex: String.raw`F_c = 6\pi\eta r v, \qquad v_{\text{уст}} = \frac{2 r^2 g (\rho_{\text{т}} - \rho_{\text{р}})}{9\eta}, \qquad v(t) = v_{\text{уст}}\left(1 - e^{-t/\tau}\right)`,
