        referenceLatex: String.raw`C_m\frac{dV_m}{dt} = I_{\text{стим}} - g_{\text{Na}}m^3h(V_m - E_{\text{Na}}) - g_{\text{K}}n^4(V_m - E_{\text{K}}) - g_L(V_m - E_L)`,
