        formulaLatex: String.raw`p(\text{Ca}^{2+}) = \frac{[\text{Ca}^{2+}]^4}{K_d^4 + [\text{Ca}^{2+}]^4}, \quad I_{\text{ПСП}} = g_{\text{син}}(V - E_{\text{рев}})`,
