        formulaLatex: String.raw`V_{\text{eq}} = \frac{C_{\mathrm{HCl}}\,V_{\mathrm{HCl}}}{C_{\mathrm{NaOH}}}, \qquad \mathrm{pH} = 14 + \lg\!\left(\frac{C_{\mathrm{NaOH}}V - C_{\mathrm{HCl}}V_0}{V_0 + V}\right) \;(V > V_{\text{eq}})`,
