        formulaLatex: String.raw`-\frac{d[A]}{dt} = k[A]^n \;\Rightarrow\; \begin{cases} [A] = [A]_0 - kt, & t_{1/2} = \frac{[A]_0}{2k} \;\;(n=0) \\ [A] = [A]_0 e^{-kt}, & t_{1/2} = \frac{\ln 2}{k} \;\;(n=1) \\ \frac{1}{[A]} = \frac{1}{[A]_0} + kt, & t_{1/2} = \frac{1}{k[A]_0} \;\;(n=2) \end{cases}`,
