        formulaLatex: String.raw`I_{\text{Tyndall}} \propto I_0\,\frac{N\,d^6}{\lambda^4}, \qquad \zeta = \frac{\sigma\,\kappa^{-1}}{\varepsilon\varepsilon_0}, \qquad \text{CCC} \propto \frac{1}{z^6}\;\;(\text{Schulze–Hardy})`,
