        referenceLatex: String.raw`Y_{\text{Hb}} = \frac{(p\text{O}_2)^n}{(P_{50})^n + (p\text{O}_2)^n}\;\;(n \approx 2.8), \quad Y_{\text{Mb}} = \frac{p\text{O}_2}{P_{50,\text{Mb}} + p\text{O}_2}\;\;(n = 1)`,
