        referenceLatex: String.raw`m = N_{\text{pool}}\cdot p(\text{Ca}^{2+}), \quad \Delta V_{\text{PSP}} = m \cdot q_{\text{quant}}, \quad V_{\text{post}} = -70\text{ mV} + \Delta V_{\text{PSP}}`,
